                <pb facs="0438" n="424" sameAs="frus:frus1945v09/pg424"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">711.35/10–1845: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the
                        Chargé in Argentina</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Cabot</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1945-10-20T13:00:00-05:00">October 20, 1945—1
                            p.m.</date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>1473. Urtel 2577, Oct 18. As long as Farrell remains President Dept believes
                    question recognition does not arise and relations with Arg Govt should continue.
                    This decision subject to review depending on events in Argentina.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Byrnes</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
